#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:2
msgid "HVM Networks"
msgstr "Redes HVM"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:6
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Importante"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page documents legacy UI/plugin network constructs for Legacy and "
"layout 1.3 clusters. They do not have a stable one-to-one mapping to "
"layout 2.0 ``hvmcli`` objects. Layout 2.0 uses Linux bridge-based Virtual"
" Switches; see :ref:`hvm_virtual_switch_read_only_verification`."
msgstr ""
"Esta página documenta los constructos de red heredados de la interfaz/plugin para clústeres Legacy y "
"layout 1.3. No tienen un mapeo estable uno a uno con los objetos ``hvmcli`` de "
"layout 2.0. Layout 2.0 utiliza Virtual Switches basados en puentes Linux; consulte :ref:`hvm_virtual_switch_read_only_verification`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:11
msgid ""
"The HVM Network Plugin delivers advanced networking capabilities for "
"|morpheus| HVM clusters. It provides a modular, plugin-based network "
"provider that separates networking from the |morpheus| core, enabling "
"independent updates, maintenance, and extensibility without impacting the"
" platform."
msgstr ""
"El plugin de red HVM ofrece capacidades avanzadas de red para "
"clústeres HVM de |morpheus|. Proporciona un proveedor de red modular basado en plugins "
"que separa la red del núcleo de |morpheus|, permitiendo "
"actualizaciones, mantenimiento y extensibilidad independientes sin impactar la"
" plataforma."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:13
msgid ""
"The plugin is purpose-built for HVM (KVM-based) clusters and manages the "
"complete lifecycle of virtual networks on cluster hosts. It automates "
"network creation, configuration, and deletion — including Open vSwitch "
"(OVS) bridge-backed port groups, VXLAN overlays, Linux VLAN interfaces, "
"MacVTAP interfaces, and SR-IOV Virtual Function (VF) networks — directly "
"from the |morpheus| user interface."
msgstr ""
"El plugin está diseñado específicamente para clústeres HVM (basados en KVM) y gestiona el "
"ciclo de vida completo de las redes virtuales en los hosts del clúster. Automatiza la "
"creación, configuración y eliminación de redes — incluyendo grupos de puertos respaldados por puentes Open vSwitch "
"(OVS), overlays VXLAN, interfaces VLAN de Linux, "
"interfaces MacVTAP y redes SR-IOV Virtual Function (VF) — directamente "
"desde la interfaz de usuario de |morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:15
msgid "Key capabilities:"
msgstr "Capacidades clave:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:17
msgid "Create and delete HVM networks of all five types directly from the UI"
msgstr "Crear y eliminar redes HVM de los cinco tipos directamente desde la interfaz de usuario"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:18
msgid ""
"Configure Standard Networks in Access, Hybrid, or Trunk-only VLAN modes "
"based on workload requirements"
msgstr ""
"Configurar redes estándar en modos VLAN de acceso, híbrido o solo troncal "
"según los requisitos de la carga de trabajo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:19
msgid ""
"Trigger trunk VLAN configuration propagation to Aruba CX switches through"
" the Aruba CX Network Plugin (Generic Integration)"
msgstr ""
"Activar la propagación de la configuración de VLAN troncal a switches Aruba CX a través"
" del plugin de red Aruba CX (Generic Integration)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:20
msgid ""
"Automatically provision or delete network configurations whenever a host "
"is added to or removed from a cluster"
msgstr ""
"Aprovisionar o eliminar automáticamente las configuraciones de red cuando un host "
"se agrega o se elimina de un clúster"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:21
msgid ""
"Detect and repair configuration drift using idempotent synchronization on"
" every refresh cycle"
msgstr ""
"Detectar y reparar la desviación de configuración mediante sincronización idempotente en"
" cada ciclo de actualización"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:22
msgid "Discover existing libvirt networks and OVS configurations on hosts"
msgstr "Descubrir redes libvirt y configuraciones OVS existentes en los hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:25
msgid "Design and Ownership Boundaries"
msgstr "Límites de diseño y responsabilidad"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:27
msgid ""
"|morpheus| applies the selected HVM network configuration; it does not "
"design the customer's physical topology. Customers remain responsible for"
" switch configuration, VLAN allocation, IP addressing, routing, DNS, MTU "
"consistency, bandwidth, redundancy, and security policy. Confirm the same"
" uplink, VLAN, and MTU intent on every cluster host before attaching "
"workloads."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| aplica la configuración de red HVM seleccionada; no "
"diseña la topología física del cliente. Los clientes siguen siendo responsables de"
" la configuración de switches, asignación de VLAN, direccionamiento IP, enrutamiento, DNS, consistencia de MTU,"
" ancho de banda, redundancia y política de seguridad. Confirme el mismo"
" uplink, VLAN y MTU en cada host del clúster antes de conectar"
" cargas de trabajo."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:29
msgid ""
"Use a dedicated storage or migration path when the workload and failure "
"analysis requires isolation or predictable bandwidth. Sharing an uplink "
"is a design choice, not a product guarantee. Jumbo frames improve nothing"
" unless every endpoint and intermediate switch supports the same MTU; "
"validate end to end before changing a production path. For layout 2.0 "
"topology choices, start with the checklist in :ref:`hvm-host-prep` and "
"use :doc:`virtual_switches`."
msgstr ""
"Utilice una ruta dedicada de almacenamiento o migración cuando la carga de trabajo y el análisis de "
"fallos requieran aislamiento o ancho de banda predecible. Compartir un uplink "
"es una decisión de diseño, no una garantía del producto. Los jumbo frames no mejoran nada"
" a menos que cada endpoint y switch intermedio soporte el mismo MTU; "
"valide de extremo a extremo antes de cambiar una ruta de producción. Para las opciones de "
"topología de layout 2.0, comience con la lista de verificación en :ref:`hvm-host-prep` y "
"utilice :doc:`virtual_switches`."

