#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:72
msgid "OVS Bridge Domain Virtual Switches"
msgstr "Virtual Switches OVS Bridge Domain"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:74
msgid ""
"Before creating Standard or Overlay networks, ensure that an OVS Bridge "
"Domain virtual switch exists in the cluster. You can either create a new "
"OVS bridge or associate the virtual switch with an existing bridge on the"
" hosts."
msgstr ""
"Antes de crear redes estándar u Overlay, asegúrese de que exista un virtual switch "
"OVS Bridge Domain en el clúster. Puede crear un nuevo "
"puente OVS o asociar el virtual switch con un puente existente en los"
" hosts."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:76
msgid ""
"An OVS Bridge Domain virtual switch is represented in |morpheus| as a "
"Network Router resource of type ``openVSwitch``. It acts as the "
"underlying virtual switching layer that backs both Standard and Overlay "
"networks, providing the bridge infrastructure required to connect "
"workloads and handle traffic forwarding within the cluster."
msgstr ""
"Un virtual switch OVS Bridge Domain se representa en |morpheus| como un "
"recurso Network Router de tipo ``openVSwitch``. Actúa como la "
"capa de conmutación virtual subyacente que respalda tanto las redes estándar como las Overlay,"
" proporcionando la infraestructura de puente necesaria para conectar "
"cargas de trabajo y gestionar el reenvío de tráfico dentro del clúster."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:80
msgid ""
"Ensure that the Name remains unique within the cluster and does not "
"conflict with any existing OVS bridges on the hosts."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrese de que el nombre sea único dentro del clúster y no "
"entre en conflicto con puentes OVS existentes en los hosts."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:83
msgid "Creating an OVS Bridge Domain Virtual Switch"
msgstr "Creación de un virtual switch OVS Bridge Domain"

