#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:106
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:371
msgid "Navigate to :menuselection:`Infrastructure --> Network --> Routers`"
msgstr "Navegue a :menuselection:`Infrastructure --> Network --> Routers`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:86
msgid "Select :guilabel:`+ Add` and choose **OVS Bridge Domain**"
msgstr "Seleccione :guilabel:`+ Add` y elija **OVS Bridge Domain**"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:87
msgid "Configure the following:"
msgstr "Configure lo siguiente:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:89
msgid "**Name** — A unique name for the virtual switch"
msgstr "**Name** — Un nombre único para el virtual switch"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:90
msgid "**Cluster** — Select the target HVM cluster"
msgstr "**Cluster** — Seleccione el clúster HVM de destino"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:91
msgid ""
"**Bridge Interface** — The host network interface backing the bridge (for"
" example, ``bond0``)"
msgstr ""
"**Bridge Interface** — La interfaz de red del host que respalda el puente (por"
" ejemplo, ``bond0``)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:93
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:162
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:231
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:255
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:272
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:337
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save`"
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`Save`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:95
msgid "The system creates the OVS bridge on all hosts in the cluster."
msgstr "El sistema crea el puente OVS en todos los hosts del clúster."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:98
msgid "Deleting an OVS Bridge Domain Virtual Switch"
msgstr "Eliminación de un virtual switch OVS Bridge Domain"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:100
msgid ""
"Deleting an OVS Bridge Domain virtual switch removes the OVS bridge from "
"all hosts in the cluster, removes the associated libvirt network "
"definitions, and removes all dependent Standard and Overlay network "
"objects from the |morpheus| database."
msgstr ""
"Eliminar un virtual switch OVS Bridge Domain elimina el puente OVS de "
"todos los hosts del clúster, elimina las definiciones de red libvirt "
"asociadas y elimina todos los objetos de red estándar y Overlay "
"dependientes de la base de datos de |morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:102
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:285
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Advertencia"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:104
msgid ""
"The system prevents deletion if any VMs are currently attached to "
"networks that depend on this virtual switch. Ensure that all such "
"networks and VMs are removed or migrated before deleting the virtual "
"switch."
msgstr ""
"El sistema impide la eliminación si alguna VM está actualmente conectada a "
"redes que dependen de este virtual switch. Asegúrese de que todas esas "
"redes y VMs se eliminen o migren antes de eliminar el virtual "
"switch."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:107
msgid "Select the OVS Bridge Domain virtual switch to delete"
msgstr "Seleccione el virtual switch OVS Bridge Domain que desea eliminar"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:108
msgid "Click the delete icon next to the virtual switch name"
msgstr "Haga clic en el icono de eliminar junto al nombre del virtual switch"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:109
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:347
msgid "Confirm the deletion when prompted"
msgstr "Confirme la eliminación cuando se le solicite"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:111
msgid ""
"The system removes the parent libvirt bridge network (the OVS bridge "
"definition) from all hosts in the cluster and deletes all dependent "
"Standard and Overlay network objects."
msgstr ""
"El sistema elimina la red de puente libvirt principal (la definición del puente OVS"
") de todos los hosts del clúster y elimina todos los objetos de red "
"estándar y Overlay dependientes."

