#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:391
msgid ""
"A new host may fail to receive networks if |morpheus| has not completed "
"host discovery or if required interfaces are not yet available for "
"propagation."
msgstr ""
"Un nuevo host puede no recibir redes si |morpheus| no ha completado "
"el descubrimiento del host o si las interfaces requeridas aún no están disponibles para "
"la propagación."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:393
msgid ""
"|morpheus| must discover the host interfaces before it can propagate "
"network definitions. If bond interface discovery remains incomplete, "
"|morpheus| cannot complete network mapping for the host."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| debe descubrir las interfaces del host antes de poder propagar "
"las definiciones de red. Si el descubrimiento de interfaces bond permanece incompleto, "
"|morpheus| no puede completar el mapeo de red para el host."

